@startuml
title APT-SD-D09 Continuity Terminal Activation and Restricted Operation Flow
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Continuity Terminal disabled by default;
if (Approved continuity activation exists?) then (yes)
  :Record Site/Site Group, dependency, incident, approval, scope;
  :Enable restricted Continuity Terminal workflows for authorized context;
  :Cashier authenticates on trusted terminal;
  :Central PMS evaluates degraded resolve policy;
  if (projection/context fresh and policy allows?) then (yes)
    :APT displays restricted degraded context and allowed actions;
  else (no)
    :Fail closed or route to supervisor/manual review;
  endif
  :All activity incident/audit/reconciliation tagged;
  :Deactivate and send activity to post-restoration review;
else (no)
  :Continuity workflows remain unavailable;
endif
stop

note right
Projection is operational visibility only.
APT does not approve degraded tariff, discount, fiscal, or exit decisions.
end note
@enduml
